flowchart LR
    A[CSV salary and random KPI per row] --> B[Initialize Job]
    A --> R[Python calculates expected salary SUM and SUM of salary i times KPI i]
    B --> C[Create context and keys]
    C --> D[Encrypt salaries and KPI]
    D --> P[Node3 port-forward 127.0.0.1:15432]
    P <--> E[(PostgreSQL)]
    R --> T[(he_demo_results)]
    P --> F[Reference SUM salary Job]
    F --> P
    P --> VS[Trusted SUM verifier copies and decrypts sum_ciphertext]
    VS --> T
    P --> G[Main Job multiply salary i by KPI i]
    G --> S[Encrypted SUM of weighted rows]
    S --> P
    P --> H[Trusted KPI verifier copies and decrypts kpi_result_ciphertext]
    H --> I[Compare expected and decrypted weighted total]
    I --> T
